<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
    <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-5xl items-center px-6 py-16">
      <section class="w-full rounded-3xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-slate-900 p-8 shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-950/40 sm:p-12">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-cyan-400">Port de plaisance Russell</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl"><%= title %></h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
          Le squelette Express 5 fonctionne avec TypeScript, EJS et Tailwind CSS.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
